---
subject: <%= it.inviterName %> invited you to join <%= it.orgName %> on <%= it.appName %>
preheader: <%= it.inviterName %> invited you to join <%= it.orgName %>.
---
<div style="margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2563eb;">Organization invitation</div><h1 style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#18181b;">You&#39;re invited to join <%= it.orgName %></h1><p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525b;"><strong style="color:#18181b;"><%= it.inviterName %></strong> invited you to collaborate in <strong style="color:#18181b;"><%= it.orgName %></strong> on <strong style="color:#18181b;"><%= it.appName %></strong>.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:24px 0 0;background-color:#fafafa;border:1px solid #e4e4e7;border-radius:10px;"><tr><td style="padding:16px 18px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#71717a;width:38%;vertical-align:top;">Organization</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#18181b;font-weight:600;vertical-align:top;"><%= it.orgName %></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#71717a;width:38%;vertical-align:top;">Invited by</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#18181b;font-weight:600;vertical-align:top;"><%= it.inviterName %></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#71717a;width:38%;vertical-align:top;">Role</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#18181b;font-weight:600;vertical-align:top;"><%= it.role || 'Member' %></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:26px 0 0;"><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#2563eb" style="border-radius:10px;background-color:#2563eb;"><a class="email-btn" href="<%= it.url %>" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 30px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;">Accept invitation</a></td></tr></table><p style="margin:22px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#71717a;">Button not working? Copy this link into your browser:</p>
<p style="margin:6px 0 0;padding:10px 12px;background-color:#f4f4f7;border:1px solid #e4e4e7;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;word-break:break-all;"><a href="<%= it.url %>" style="color:#2563eb;text-decoration:none;"><%= it.url %></a></p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:24px 0 0;"><tr><td style="padding:12px 14px;background-color:#fafafa;border-left:3px solid #d4d4d8;border-radius:4px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#71717a;">If you weren&#39;t expecting this invitation, you can safely ignore this email.</td></tr></table>
===TEXT===
You've been invited to <%= it.orgName %>

<%= it.inviterName %> has invited you to join <%= it.orgName %> on
<%= it.appName %><% if (it.role) { %> as <%= it.role %><% } %>.

Accept the invitation by opening the link below:

  <%= it.url %>

If you weren't expecting this invitation, you can safely ignore this email.
